{"ts": "2026-11-16T21:13:27.148+00:00", "session_id": "ING2_ingest1_20261117_001325", "event": "graph_step", "run_id": "96830a85-748b-464e-bff0-daff3310f383", "step": 2, "node": "model", "messages": [{"type": "AIMessage", "id": "lc_run--01a1e635-2a07-730a-8f99-53bb2608c7d8-0", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-ba7a45ed76ac1756", "name": "load_skill", "args": {"name": "build_corpus_levels"}}, {"id": "chatcmpl-tool-9d7ecaf9d472296d", "name": "ls", "args": {"path": "input/new_files"}}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 7049, "output_tokens": 55, "total_tokens": 7104, "input_token_details": {}, "output_token_details": {}}}]}
{"ts": "2026-11-16T21:13:27.156+00:00", "session_id": "ING2_ingest1_20261117_001325", "event": "graph_step", "run_id": "96830a85-748b-464e-bff0-daff3310f383", "step": 3, "node": "tools", "messages": [{"type": "ToolMessage", "id": "53ab4598-208e-4738-9d36-2a4aa57db3dd", "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"tool\": \"load_skill\", \"data\": {\"name\": \"build_corpus_levels\", \"description\": \"Add organized documents to the L0/L1/L2 corpus - outline, read, write the L1 structure and summary, index L2 fragments and embeddings in Elasticsearch, validate. Use for \\\"добавь в корпус\\\", \\\"проиндексируй папку\\\", \\\"построй L0/L1/L2\\\", ingestion of new files.\", \"instructions\": \"# build_corpus_levels — procedure\\n\\n## 1. Organize first\\n- Every file of the input folder goes to `data/<topic>/` with `move` (lab 1 rules: by content, no overwrite, empty -> `data/_unsorted/`).\\n- Only documents in `data/` with a document_id can get L1/L2.\\n\\n## 2. What is missing\\n- `corpus_status` lists documents without L1 or with stale L2. Do not redo documents that are current (idempotent re-run).\\n\\n## 3. L1 per document (your decisions)\\n- `doc_outline(path)`: lines, headings, suggested_sections. A file WITHOUT headings needs your own sections by line ranges.\\n- Read the text: `read_lines` for small files; `read_pages` / `search_text` for large ones (never the whole file in one call).\\n- `write_l1(document_id, title, description, summary, sections)`:\\n  - summary: 3-6 sentences in Russian from the content: purpose, key facts, codes (ERR_..., INC-..., РС-...), numbers, links to other documents;\\n  - sections: ordered, non-overlapping, together they cover every non-blank line; 1-2 sentence summary each;\\n  - if the harness answers `invalid_structure`, fix the ranges as reported.\\n\\n## 4. L2\\n- `index_document(document_id)` cuts deterministic fragments inside your sections, embeds them and upserts into Elasticsearch.\\n  Re-running on an unchanged document returns `unchanged` - no duplicates.\\n\\n## 5. Finish\\n- `validate_corpus` must return ok=true; then `complete_task(note)` with counts (documents, fragments).\"}}", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ba7a45ed76ac1756", "name": "load_skill", "status": "success"}]}
